    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but it sounds like a pretty lopsided trade-off. if the \"benefit\" is just managing how much power big countries can grab without causing a total war, isn't that just a way of legitimizing the status quo instead of actually helping smaller nations? feels like the UN just validates whatever the big players decide is okay.",
